l"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p008","text":"太史公曰：「先人有言：『自周公卒五百歲而有孔子。孔子卒後至於今五百歲，有能紹明世，正易傳，繼春秋，本詩書禮樂之際？』意在斯乎！意在斯乎！小子何敢讓焉。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m008-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m008-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"周公","kind":"person","person_id":"lxl_vec_rli","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m008-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m008-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p009","text":"上大夫壺遂曰：「昔孔子何為而作春秋哉？」太史公曰：「余聞董生曰：『周道衰廢，孔子為魯司寇，諸侯害之，大夫壅之。孔子知言之不用，道之不行也，是非二百四十二年之中，以為天下儀表，貶天子，退諸侯，討大夫，以達王事而已矣。』子曰：『我欲載之空言，不如見之於行事之深切著明也。』夫春秋，上明三王之道，下辨人事之紀，別嫌疑，明是非，定猶豫，善善惡惡，賢賢賤不肖，存亡國，繼絕世，補敝起廢，王道之大者也。易著天地陰陽四時五行，故長於變；禮經紀人倫，故長於行；書記先王之事，故長於政；詩記山川谿谷禽獸草木牝牡雌雄，故長於風；樂樂所以立，故長於和；春秋辯是非，故長於治人。是故禮以節人，樂以發和，書以道事，詩以達意，易以道化，春秋以道義。撥亂世反之正，莫近於春秋。春秋文成數萬，其指數千。萬物之散聚皆在春秋。春秋之中，弒君三十六，亡國五十二，諸侯奔走不得保其社稷者不可勝數。察其所以，皆失其本已。故易曰『失之豪釐，差以千里』。故曰『臣弒君，子弒父，非一旦一夕之故也，其漸久矣』。故有國者不可以不知春秋，前有讒而弗見，後有賊而不知。為人臣者不可以不知春秋，守經事而不知其宜，遭變事而不知其權。為人君父而不通於春秋之義者，必蒙首惡之名。為人臣子而不通於春秋之義者，必陷篡弒之誅，死罪之名。其實皆以為善，為之不知其義，被之空言而不敢辭。夫不通禮義之旨，至於君不君，臣不臣，父不父，子不子。夫君不君則犯，臣不臣則誅，父不父則無道，子不子則不孝。此四行者，天下之大過也。以天下之大過予之，則受而弗敢辭。故春秋者，禮義之大宗也。夫禮禁未然之前，法施已然之後；法之所為用者易見，而禮之所為禁者難知。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m009-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"壺遂","kind":"person","person_id":"sxq_1wd_ih9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m009-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m009-0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m009-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"董生","kind":"person","person_id":"5qk_j3d_hcd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m009-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m009-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p010","text":"壺遂曰：「孔子之時，上無明君，下不得任用，故作春秋，垂空文以斷禮義，當一王之法。今夫子上遇明天子，下得守職，萬事既具，咸各序其宜，夫子所論，欲以何明？」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m010-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"壺遂","kind":"person","person_id":"sxq_1wd_ih9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m010-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m010-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"夫子","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m010-0045","start":45,"end":48,"surface":"明天子","kind":"person","person_id":"xqy_bvp_g1a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m010-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"夫子","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p011","text":"太史公曰：「唯唯，否否，不然。余聞之先人曰：『伏羲至純厚，作易八卦。堯舜之盛，尚書載之，禮樂作焉。湯武之隆，詩人歌之。春秋采善貶惡，推三代之德，褒周室，非獨刺譏而已也。』漢興以來，至明天子，獲符瑞，封禪，改正朔，易服色，受命於穆清，澤流罔極，海外殊俗，重譯款塞，請來獻見者，不可勝道。臣下百官力誦聖德，猶不能宣盡其意。且士賢能而不用，有國者之恥；主上明聖而德不布聞，有司之過也。且余嘗掌其官，廢明聖盛德不載，滅功臣世家賢大夫之業不述，墮先人所言，罪莫大焉。余所謂述故事，整齊其世傳，非所謂作也，而君比之於春秋，謬矣。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"先人","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"伏羲","kind":"person","person_id":"0xr_z2z_lne","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"0ea_a78_okm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ab2_pxs_34r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"湯武","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"明天子","kind":"person","person_id":"xqy_bvp_g1a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0218","start":218,"end":220,"surface":"先人","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p012","text":"於是論次其文。七年而太史公遭李陵之禍，幽於縲紲。乃喟然而嘆曰：「是余之罪也夫！是余之罪也夫！身毀不用矣。」退而深惟曰：「夫詩書隱約者，欲遂其志之思也。昔西伯拘羑里，演周易；孔子戹陳蔡，作春秋；屈原放逐，著離騷；左丘失明，厥有國語；孫子臏腳，而論兵法；不韋遷蜀，世傳呂覽；韓非囚秦，說難、孤憤；詩三百篇，大抵賢聖發憤之所為作也。此人皆意有所郁結，不得通其道也，故述往事，思來者。」於是卒述陶唐以來，至于麟止，自黃帝始。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"李陵","kind":"person","person_id":"3tq_5qz_qb9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"西伯","kind":"person","person_id":"yi5_jym_uoz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"8zh_d7n_e93","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"屈原","kind":"person","person_id":"e7f_ip0_jk1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"左丘","kind":"person","person_id":"asu_nj9_wb8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"孫子","kind":"person","person_id":"0jo_9fp_dpo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"不韋","kind":"person","person_id":"puu_6hs_m4f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0135","start":135,"end":137,"surface":"韓非","kind":"person","person_id":"0ze_qgj_quv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m012-0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"ocd_ibe_at1","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p142","text":"維我漢繼五帝末流，接三代絕業。周道廢，秦撥去古文，焚滅詩書，故明堂石室金匱玉版圖籍散亂。於是漢興，蕭何次律令，韓信申軍法，張蒼為章程，叔孫通定禮儀，則文學彬彬稍進，詩書往往閒出矣。自曹參薦蓋公言黃老，而賈生、晁錯明申、商，公孫弘以儒顯，百年之閒，天下遺文古事靡不畢集太史公。太史公仍父子相續纂其職。曰：「於戲！余維先人嘗掌斯事，顯於唐虞，至于周，復典之，故司馬氏世主天官。至於余乎，欽念哉！欽念哉！」罔羅天下放失舊聞，王跡所興，原始察終，見盛觀衰，論考之行事，略推三代，錄秦漢，上記軒轅，下至于茲，著十二本紀，既科條之矣。并時異世，年差不明，作十表。禮樂損益，律歷改易，兵權山川鬼神，天人之際，承敝通變，作八書。二十八宿環北辰，三十輻共一轂，運行無窮，輔拂股肱之臣配焉，忠信行道，以奉主上，作三十世家。扶義俶儻，不令己失時，立功名於天下，作七十列傳。凡百三十篇，五十二萬六千五百字，為太史公書。序略，以拾遺補闕，成一家之言，厥協六經異傳，整齊百家雜語，藏之名山，副在京師，俟後世聖人君子。第七十。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"五帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"蕭何","kind":"person","person_id":"1xf_5a0_n0p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"2nx_tda_i4j","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"張蒼","kind":"person","person_id":"cf6_ekq_84s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0067","start":67,"end":70,"surface":"叔孫通","kind":"person","person_id":"axb_hsg_0lj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"曹參","kind":"person","person_id":"diy_04a_wsu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"蓋公","kind":"person","person_id":"kaz_pcf_2vd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"黃老","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"賈生","kind":"person","person_id":"eba_45k_rot","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"晁錯","kind":"person","person_id":"cic_28p_bjp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0107","start":107,"end":110,"surface":"申、商","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m142-0